# Sprint 2.3 - Finance Module
Version: 1.0
Status: Approved
Priority: HIGH

---

# Objective

Implement Finance Module V1 for CenterManager.

Finance is an administration module responsible for:

- Recording income
- Recording expenses
- Tracking outstanding tuition
- Providing financial dashboard

Finance is NOT the starting point of business workflows.

Student remains the center of the business process.

---

# IMPORTANT DESIGN PRINCIPLES

## Principle 1

Student owns business.

Finance owns money.

Dashboard owns visualization.

Each module must have only ONE responsibility.

---

## Principle 2

Finance Dashboard never stores calculated values.

Everything must be calculated from source data.

---

## Principle 3

Outstanding Tuition is NOT stored.

It is calculated in real time.

Outstanding

=

Expected Tuition

-

Paid Amount

---

## Principle 4

Do NOT redesign existing UI.

Only implement business functionality.

